Instances are bootstrapped in the order `zulu`, `alpha`, `mike` and reported sorted by slug, each
carrying its own status and frontier — `mike` sits on the terminal status and so has no `next`,
while the two still mid-run keep theirs.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-steps/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-steps
title: Steps
summary: Per-instance fixture for playbook-state.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-steps/playbook.yaml --
graph:
  intake: []
  step-pipeline:
    dependencies: [intake]
    state: step
    graph:
      spec: []

states:
  step:
    artifact: steps/{instance}/index.md
    initial: spec-ing
    statuses:
      spec-ing:
        transitions:
          - to: done
            when: spec written
      done: {terminal: true}
